profile.comment=Fast drops shafts and uses a smaller shadow map. Balanced is the default look. Cinematic lengthens the march and softens shadows.

option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT=Volumetric light
option.VOLUMETRIC_LIGHT.comment=Shafts of light from the shadow map. Faint at noon, stronger when the sun is low.

option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Size of the shadow map. Higher is sharper and costs more.

option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=How wide the soft edge of a shadow is.

option.VOL_STEPS=Volumetric steps
option.VOL_STEPS.comment=Samples along each view ray. More steps, cleaner shafts.

option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom strength
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Halo on the sun, lava, and other bright surfaces. Quieter at noon than at sunset.

option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog density
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=How quickly pewter mist thickens after the first 24 blocks. Nearby ground stays clear.

